      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAYNE CARGO (8) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 2.75 lengths into second (19.76) at this track in a NG over 340m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Must come into calculations. SCOOTIN' SCOOBY (4) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a neck (30.85) behind Cheryl Blue at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Deserves a win and gets his chance. RUTLAND SNICKERS (1) was a last start winner (25.14) from Box 8 at this track. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. MY MACHINE (6) scored in dominant fashion last time. That form reads well.",
